{"server":"cn","storyId":"act18side_level_act18side_08_end","groupId":"act18side","stageId":"act18side_08","title":"命运","storyCode":"LE-8","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act18side/level_act18side_08_end.txt","sourceHash":"041cc2845068f8e8e7d13b7bd8214332502fd5c49ad571fab022e556fbba127c","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"死战过后，夕照区的危机终于解除，黑键与白垩却面临着更加残酷的命运。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g8_concerthall_outside_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爷爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"傻孩子，真是个傻孩子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爷爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你明明可以不用做这样的事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爷爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这片大地欠你这么多，你又何必做到这一步？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老先生？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请您赶快离开！这里的源石活性正在不断上升！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爷爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还想见我孙子最后一面呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就差最后一下了，芙蓉，拜托你牵制他的注意力——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爷爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白垩，爷爷在这儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爷爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白垩，我亲爱的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爷爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你觉得有怨气，就冲我来吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爷爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在你毁掉更多东西之前，先冲我来吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爷爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我骗了你许多年，瞒了你许多年......我想过因你而死，却没想过你会遭遇这样的结局！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爷爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你选择让其他人活下去，那就让时日无多的我随你而去，又有何妨？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爷爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我再陪你一程吧，我亲爱的孩子！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"源石结晶组成的怪物不能理解老人的话。\n刚刚那瞬间的清醒已经是奇迹中的奇迹，此时的怪物只想随着大提琴声，将四周拖入永久的虚无。\n于是，怪物循着声音传来的方向，全力喷吐死亡的旋律。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老先生？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爷爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姑娘，你何必——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——黑键，这里由我挡住，趁现在！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喝啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么可能？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"友情、牺牲、奉献——如此幼稚的信念，就应该在现实中摔得粉身碎骨，凭什么，凭什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，还没有结束！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白垩确实把两段尘世之音强行纳入了自己这一侧，可他最终还是敌不过它们叠加在一起的无序和疯狂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听得见，白垩的旋律已经消散殆尽，但黑键的尘世之音并未离去，我还——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔呃！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"够了，斯特罗洛伯爵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"格特鲁德刚刚搭上琴弦的手无力地垂下。\n别格勒把匕首从格特鲁德的后背抽出，血染脏了他的衣服。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"源石外壳层层崩解。\n广场上失去了声音，只有失去活性的源石外壳落在地上的沉闷响动。\n最后，外壳尽数剥落，留在原地的，是奄奄一息的白垩，还有他身边的大提琴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g8_concerthall_outside_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等着我......等着我！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！他现在很危险，我们该做的是呼叫感染者临终事务处......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......白垩不会死的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白垩，你醒了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到了吗，白垩有救的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑键......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在这里，我在这里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别......白费力气了，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（深呼吸）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我觉得......身体好轻......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚刚一直很痛，但现在好多了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，会好的，肯定会好的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听好了，黑键，这是我最后一次跟你说话了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"记着我的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑键，你要活下去，你要走过漫长的夜晚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要去反抗那些不公的命运，并且孜孜不倦地为他人付出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有这样，当你坐下来的时候，才会想到我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会问你，黑键，你今天过得如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后，你会挺起胸膛告诉我，你又度过了充实的一天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你会向我倾诉你在行善过程中遭遇的障碍，以及抱怨命运始终不愿青睐于你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是没有关系，我会倾听你的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为你是那么努力，你当然可以去抱怨一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有这样，你才不会被这片大地上的苦痛所淹没，你才能在你的生活中获得安宁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"记着，黑键，我们曾经一同反抗了不公平的命，而我们得了胜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，想到我的时候，你应当笑，而不是哭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，对不起啊，黑键。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还没有想好......应该给你什么信物比较......好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你送我什么都可以的，求求你别死，求求你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白垩，白垩......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白垩！！！！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们总有一天会摔得粉身碎骨的，但不是现在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"友情、牺牲、奉献......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们可能确实有些幼稚，但至少有人会为他们掬一把同情泪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你呢，斯特罗洛伯爵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你亲手毁掉了自己和车尔尼之间萌生的友情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你杀掉了自己的亲兄弟，还要嘲弄他的无能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想让别人为你奉献，可你给了别人什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"格特鲁德真的不再动弹，只剩嘴唇还在蠕动。\n“我诅咒你们。”\n别格勒读懂了格特鲁德的唇语。\n“我诅咒你死于阴暗的沟渠。”\n“我诅咒黑键永远无法摆脱血脉中的疯狂。”\n“我诅咒夕照区走向衰颓。”\n“我诅咒莱塔尼亚永远在巫王的阴影下颤抖。”\n“我诅咒巫王永远得不到死后的安宁。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......实在太难看了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我承认自己刚刚有些冲动，但紧急处理威胁大众安全的因素，这也是我的职责之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会替你写一份翔实的报告的，斯特罗洛伯爵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晚安，祝你做个不用诅咒别人的梦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g8_concerthall_outside_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的手在流血！难道是被源石结晶刺到了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，好像......是出了点血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你得立刻接受必要的救治——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"救治？现在要救治的是白垩啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑键，他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别说那个词，芙蓉，我求求你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他......毕竟是感染者，黑键，就当是为他考虑，如果你不想联系感染者临终事务处，至少找个密封性良好的房间......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白，我明白......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就......音乐厅休息室吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我送他过去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白垩，来，我抱你进去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑键小心翼翼地抱起白垩，身上被源石刺出更多伤口，但他无暇顾及。\n他抱着朋友慢慢失去温度的身体，就像抱着一个短暂而美好的梦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g9_auditorium"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白垩，我们马上就到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很快的，很快我们就到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还——活着？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我这就带你出去，去找芙蓉——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"把我安顿在这座建筑里吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果你以后还能回到夕照区，你就会想起，你有一个很好很好的朋友，你和他在这里争吵过，欢笑过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"最后，你和他共同献上了一场精彩的合奏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不对，你不是白垩，你是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但这难道不是你想要的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老头，闭嘴，我不允许你这样玷污他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白垩为了清除尘世之音付出了生命，可尘世之音......还在我的脑子里？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我警告你，如果你还想模仿他，我不介意在这儿把自己的头打爆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"脑海中的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（叹息声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"脑海中的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我愚蠢的血脉啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"再没有什么声音出现在黑键耳畔。\n他只是抱着白垩越来越沉重的身体，一步一步地朝夕照厅的休息室走去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g11_lounge"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去做密封工作，你在沙发上躺好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里的沙发挺软和的，你躺着一定很舒服——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沙发、软和......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你甚至没睡过家里的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我大概真是感染了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前要花点精力才能用的法术，现在几乎不费劲。看来感染了也挺好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，这样就差不多了。门等我出去再封上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有......什么愿望吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"纪念......对了，纪念。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那把大提琴，我就拿走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我给你买的东西，现在我又要拿走，真是......"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑键的嘴唇动了动，没说出话。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他静静站立片刻，弯下腰，轻轻把自己用惯了的长笛放在白垩身边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你之前说想要一个钻了孔的硬币，可我现在只剩这把长笛了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"对不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"对不起......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
